{"3771770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SURVEILLANCE DUTY: Twisted Sight", "steam_appid": 3771770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the cameras, report anomalies, and follow Dr. Amalia’s instructions. Your shift is simple on paper: observe, classify, survive. But the longer you remain at the terminal, the more the system begins to react not only to what you report, but to what you choose to do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/e3c62fc1de2f608061ff06fda23f8206.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been assigned to a permanent surveillance post.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to monitor the installed cameras and immediately report any anomalies: changes in the environment, image distortion, the appearance of unauthorized objects, or entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every inconsistency must be registered through the report interface<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring deviations will lead to their accumulation and loss of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: you are not allowed to leave your post without permission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doubting the reality of what you observe does not release you from responsibility.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.poster.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.webm?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.mp4?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/faf2fd6df0d15aac57f2f7dc54a2c110.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will not be alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Amalia is your curator, assistant, and overseer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will help you understand the surveillance system, comment on your work, and remind you what matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She monitors your reports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She monitors your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She monitors your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused. Do not give her a reason to look closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.poster.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.webm?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.mp4?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/8badbfb0e310ab89971903953bac220d.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may notice visual distortions, signal failures, or interference on the screens. This is normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies are disguised as technical malfunctions. Some objects may appear interactive. Some elements of the interface may seem unnecessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not attempt to adjust the equipment yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not launch unauthorized programs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not play games during your shift.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain at your post. Continue observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.poster.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.webm?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.mp4?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/de49d3df06d1d157e7e5bfc2ebf0e107.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official reports do not explain what happened.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The recordings stopped suddenly. The signal was lost. The operators never made contact again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The room remained locked from the inside. No signs of struggle were found. No bodies were found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now you are here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In front of the same screens.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the same task.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the same supervision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe carefully. Miss nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And try not to follow their path.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/02821d75f678633595142a2513dcf708.webp?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not every message will appear inside the surveillance system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the game may speak to you where you expected a reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes, an <u>achievement</u> may sound like a correction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, like a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the system reacts to your choices, it means it has already noticed you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the cameras, report anomalies, and follow Dr. Amalia’s instructions. Your shift is simple on paper: observe, classify, survive. But the longer you remain at the terminal, the more the system begins to react not only to what you report, but to what you choose to do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/e3c62fc1de2f608061ff06fda23f8206.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been assigned to a permanent surveillance post.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to monitor the installed cameras and immediately report any anomalies: changes in the environment, image distortion, the appearance of unauthorized objects, or entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every inconsistency must be registered through the report interface<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring deviations will lead to their accumulation and loss of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: you are not allowed to leave your post without permission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doubting the reality of what you observe does not release you from responsibility.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.poster.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.webm?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.mp4?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/faf2fd6df0d15aac57f2f7dc54a2c110.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will not be alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Amalia is your curator, assistant, and overseer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will help you understand the surveillance system, comment on your work, and remind you what matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She monitors your reports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She monitors your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She monitors your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused. Do not give her a reason to look closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.poster.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.webm?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.mp4?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/8badbfb0e310ab89971903953bac220d.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may notice visual distortions, signal failures, or interference on the screens. This is normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies are disguised as technical malfunctions. Some objects may appear interactive. Some elements of the interface may seem unnecessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not attempt to adjust the equipment yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not launch unauthorized programs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not play games during your shift.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain at your post. Continue observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.poster.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.webm?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.mp4?t=1785409415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/de49d3df06d1d157e7e5bfc2ebf0e107.avif?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official reports do not explain what happened.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The recordings stopped suddenly. The signal was lost. The operators never made contact again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The room remained locked from the inside. No signs of struggle were found. No bodies were found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now you are here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In front of the same screens.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the same task.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the same supervision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe carefully. Miss nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And try not to follow their path.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/02821d75f678633595142a2513dcf708.webp?t=1785409415\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not every message will appear inside the surveillance system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the game may speak to you where you expected a reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes, an <u>achievement</u> may sound like a correction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, like a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the system reacts to your choices, it means it has already noticed you.</p>", "short_description": "A real-time surveillance thriller where you control security systems, switch between dozens of camera feeds, and react to anomalies before everything collapses. Observe or perish.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/dd5974ae0c471600082ba0b6dd7f4f30109f0318/header.jpg?t=1785409415", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/6e260fb33da4e1c3b22d781716a83fb26cf05d2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785409415", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/6e260fb33da4e1c3b22d781716a83fb26cf05d2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785409415", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 3GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super / AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Nightroot Games"], "publishers": ["Nightroot Games"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 799, "final": 799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$7.99"}, "packages": [1327051], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy SURVEILLANCE DUTY: Twisted Sight", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1327051, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option